# tasks.md — Apolaki Assessment Flow Improvement

## Objective

Improve the existing Apolaki assessment flow using the AI workflow model:

Intent → Input → Processing → Insight → Decision → Action → Feedback Loop

Primary hook:

> Replace your electricity bill with a lower monthly payment.

---

## Phase 1 — Intent Capture

### Task 1.1 — Add Financing-First Hero
- Add headline: “Replace your electricity bill with a lower monthly payment”
- Add supporting copy: “See how your current bill could become a lower solar payment”
- Add CTA: “See My New Monthly Cost”
- Ensure CTA scrolls or routes user into the assessment flow

### Task 1.2 — Add Example Payment Swap
- Display sample transformation:
  - Current bill: ₱12,000
  - Solar payment: ₱7,500
  - Monthly savings: ₱4,500
- Make this visual and prominent

---

## Phase 2 — Input Capture

### Task 2.1 — Convert Assessment Into Guided Steps
- Step 1: Monthly electricity bill
- Step 2: Location
- Step 3: Property type
- Add progress indicator: “Step X of 3”
- Add helper text: “Takes less than 30 seconds”

### Task 2.2 — Improve Bill Input
- Make monthly bill the primary input
- Add currency formatting for PHP
- Add validation:
  - Required
  - Must be numeric
  - Must be greater than 0

### Task 2.3 — Improve Location Input
- Add city/province dropdown for Philippines
- Add optional auto-detect location
- Add fallback manual selection

### Task 2.4 — Default Property Type
- Default to Residential
- Keep SME as optional secondary selection
- Do not include Enterprise in MVP

