## MVP Definition of Done

The MVP is complete when:

- User can enter bill, location, and property type
- System shows a lower monthly solar payment estimate
- Results prioritize monthly payment swap
- User can submit name and phone after seeing results
- Lead is stored with assessment context
- Core funnel events are tracked
- Flow works well on mobile